# # /sosa-ssn-observatory/
#
# The SOSA/SSN Usage Observatory: a knowledge graph of how the scientific
# literature uses the W3C/OGC Semantic Sensor Network ontology (SOSA/SSN),
# with a web explorer.
#
# https://w3id.org/sosa-ssn-observatory/ and everything under it redirects to
# https://ci.mines-stetienne.fr/sosa-ssn-observatory/
#
# Code and data: https://github.com/maximelefrancois86/sosa-ssn-observatory
# DOI: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24223888
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Maxime Lefrançois, Mines Saint-Étienne
# GitHub username: maximelefrancois86

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://ci.mines-stetienne.fr/sosa-ssn-observatory/$1 [R=302,L]
